                </div>
                <div class="comp-footnotes__note">
                    <a href="javascript:;" id="footnote8" class="comp-footnotes__note-num" aria-label="Go to inline footnote 8"><sup>8</sup></a>
                    <div class="comp-footnotes__content"><p>The <a href="https://www.americanprogress.org/issues/early-childhood/reports/2018/12/06/461643/americas-child-care-deserts-2018/">Center for American Progress</a> defines a &ldquo;child care desert&rdquo; as a census tract where there are more than three young children for every licensed child care slot.</p></div>
                </div>
