                    <div class="comp-footnotes__content"><p>Pinto, Santiago, and John Bailey Jones. &ldquo;<a href="https://www.richmondfed.org/publications/research/coronavirus/economic_impact_covid-19_05-22-20#:~:text=Lower%20educational%20attainment%20is%20associated,in%20political%20and%20social%20institutions.#:~:text=Lower%20educational%20attainment%20is%20associated,in%20political%20and%20social%20institutions.">The Long-Term Effects of Educational Disruptions</a>.&rdquo; Richmond Fed Economic Impact of COVID-19, May 22, 2020.</p></div>
